# Keep host dependencies and build outputs out of Linux image builds.
#
# Every Dockerfile installs and builds inside the image, so none of these belong in a build context.
# They matter most in the e2e job (.github/workflows/e2e.yml), which builds the stack from a
# checkout the host has just installed and built: without this file each `COPY <package-dir>` would
# carry that host state, never match the layer cache docker.yml writes from a clean checkout on
# main, and rebuild every image from that layer down.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.DS_Store
